SUMMARY:This Week In the Lab: Snap Circuits
DESCRIPTION:Join the Maker   STEAM Team in the Innovation Lab during 
 specified open hours to explore the properties of electricity and circuit 
 building! Use SNAP circuits to easily build and test hundreds of possible 
 experiments and perform different tasks with electricity!\n\nThis is a 
 self-paced\, drop-in activity. You can drop in during the listed Open Lab 
 Hours.\n\nInnovation Lab Open Hours:\n\nMonday: Closed\nTuesday: 1pm - 
 5pm\nWednesday: 3pm - 7pm\nThursday: 10am - 2pm\nFriday: 1pm - 
 5pm\nSaturday: 11am - 1pm and 3pm - 5pm\n\nHours subject to change based on 
 staffing and programming needs.
LOCATION:Main Library (300 N. Roxboro St)
ORGANIZER;CN="Caroline Flory":MAILTO:cflory@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:Arts & Crafts, Maker, STEAM
