DTEND:20260502T170000Z
DTSTAMP:20260502T000000Z
SUMMARY:The Homebuyer Blueprint
DESCRIPTION:Ready to stop renting and start building wealth through 
 homeownership? Join us for an informative and engaging homebuyer session 
 designed to walk you through the entire process—from preparing 
 financially to closing on your dream home.\n\nDuring this session\, we’ll 
 break down what it really takes to buy a home in today’s market\, how to 
 position yourself as a strong buyer\, and how working with the right team 
 can save you time\, stress\, and money. You’ll also hear directly from a 
 trusted lender about financing options\, credit insights\, and down payment 
 assistance programs.\n\nWhether you’re just starting to think about 
 buying or ready to make a move soon\, this session will give you the 
 clarity\, confidence\, and strategy you need.\n\nCome ready to learn\, ask 
 questions\, and take your next step toward homeownership.\n\nThis 
 instructional workshop is presented by Shawndria McCoy\, real estate broker 
 and founder of McCoy Homes Realty\, and Alexandria Tindall\, community 
 mortgage loan officer and assistant vice president of North State Bank.\n\n 
 \n\nTo attend this workshop\, register here.
LOCATION:East Meeting Room\, East Regional Library (211 Lick Creek Lane)
ORGANIZER;CN="Austin Daniels":MAILTO:ausdaniels@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:Business, Finance
UID:LibCal-14288-16730650
URL:https://durhamcountylibrary.libcal.com/event/16730650
END:VEVENT
