SUMMARY:Once Upon a Cuento (Bilingual Storytime/ Hora de Cuentos Bilingüe)
DESCRIPTION:Join us the 2nd Friday of each month for a bilingual storytime 
 in partnership with the library's Community Engagement Staff! 
 \n\nTogether\, we will read books and sing songs in both English and 
 Spanish! \n\nIntended ages: 0-5 years old and their 
 families\n\nRegistration is appreciated. \n\n\nÚnase a nosotros el 2do 
 viernes de cada mes para una hora de cuentos bilingües.\n\n¡Juntos 
