SUMMARY:Ready\, Set\, Baby (Spanish) at North Regional Library
DESCRIPTION:Clases prenatales gratuitas sobre lactancia materna\, 
 diseñadas para ayudar a las familias a prepararse para la llegada de un 
 nuevo bebé\, ya sean padres primerizos o que estén ampliando su familia. 
 Estas clases son una excelente manera de prepararse para el embarazo\, el 
 parto y la vida con un recién nacido. Recibirá información útil sobre 
 la lactancia materna\, el cuidado posparto y qué esperar durante las 
 primeras semanas. Nuestra clase está repleta de charlas\, recursos y ¡un 
 obsequio al final! Se ofrecerán refrigerios. Cupo limitado. ¡Inscríbase 
 en línea!\n\n \n\nReady\, Set\, Baby Classes:  Free prenatal breastfeeding 
 education class designed to help you get ready for your baby\, whether you 
 are a first-time parent or adding to your family. These classes are a great 
 way to prepare for pregnancy\, birth\, and life with a newborn. You’ll 
 get helpful information on breastfeeding\, postpartum care\, and what to 
 expect in those early weeks. Our class is packed with conversations\, 
 resources\, and a raffle prize at the end! You’ll have a chance to win 
 amazing prizes like:\n\n\n	Breast pumps\n	Diaper bags filled with baby 
 essentials\n	Car seats\n	Breastfeeding pillows\n	…and more! 
 \n\n\nRegistration required. Questions? Please contact Jasmine at 
 jjohnson@dconc.gov. \n\n \n\nCan't make it to this location? These classes 
 will be held at all Durham County locations over the next couple of months. 
 See the flyer below for the upcoming dates at the other locations!
LOCATION:North Meeting Room - Full Room\, North Regional Library (221 Milton Rd)
ORGANIZER;CN="Molly Schaefer":MAILTO:mschaefer@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:Classes & Lectures, Health & Fitness
UID:LibCal-14288-16382761
URL:https://durhamcountylibrary.libcal.com/event/16382761
END:VEVENT
