SUMMARY:North Regional Children's Program Break
DESCRIPTION:The North Regional Children’s team will be on a program break 
 from Friday\, May 1 through Saturday\, May 30\, 2026. During this time\, 
 there will be no regular storytimes or elementary afterschool programs as 
 staff prepare for Summer Reading. However\, a few special events will still 
 take place—be sure to check them out!\n\n\n	Ready\, Set\, Baby (English) 
 — Saturday\, May 2\, 2026\, at 10a.m. \n	Ready\, Set\, Baby (Spanish) — 
 Saturday\, May 9\, 2026\, at 10a.m. \n	Homeschool Learning Lab- Thursdays 
 at 10a.m. \n	Read to Me (Pet Partners Reading Dog Program) — Saturday\, 
 May 16\, 2026\, at 10a.m. \n	Kid's Craft: Patriotic Pinwheels — 
 Saturday\, May 24\, 2026\, at 10a.m. \n	Little Stars: Shining Bright at 
 Baby Prom! — Saturday\, May 30\, 2026\, at 9:30a.m.\n\n\nPrograms resume 
 on Monday\, June 1\, 2026. \n\nQuestions? Please reach out to Molly at 
 mschaefer@dconc.gov. Thank you for your understanding! \n
